# from test_reflection_synonyms.rs: edit the Rust test, then run the script again

# properties_lists_the_fields
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); p.properties' ['x', 'y']
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); properties of p' ['x', 'y']
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); P(3, 4).properties' ['x', 'y']

# reflection_words_as_calls
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); fields(p)' ['x', 'y']
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); fields(P)' ['x', 'y']
# triage-held 2026-11-06: reflection synonyms (properties, fields, attributes, functions of), one word each is enough :: is! 'class P{x:int; y:int; sq() := x*x+y*y}; p = P(1, 2); attributes(P(1, 2))' ['x', 'y']

